# API keys are NOT stored in .env files. Use dotnet user-secrets locally (see README).
# Outside local dev, configuration comes from environment variables, for example:
# ConnectionStrings__Default=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=podcast;Username=podcast;Password=podcast
# Llm__ApiKey=
# Tts__Google__ApiKey=
# Auth__Jwt__SigningKey=   (32+ random bytes, e.g. openssl rand -base64 48)
